@startuml
actor 用户
participant "PredictPage.vue" as PredictPage
participant "predictAPI" as PredictAPI
participant "predict_routes.py" as PredictRoutes
participant "ml_pipeline.py" as MLPipeline
database "MySQL" as MySQL
collections "模型文件" as ModelFile

用户 -> PredictPage : 打开预测页
PredictPage -> PredictAPI : getSalesForecast()
PredictAPI -> PredictRoutes : GET /api/predict/sales
PredictRoutes -> MLPipeline : predict_sales_for_api()
MLPipeline -> ModelFile : load_model()
MLPipeline -> MySQL : 读取商品与历史销售数据
MySQL --> MLPipeline : 返回训练特征与商品信息
MLPipeline -> MLPipeline : 递归预测未来7天销量
MLPipeline --> PredictRoutes : 168 条预测结果
PredictRoutes --> PredictAPI : JSON 响应
PredictAPI --> PredictPage : 预测列表

PredictPage -> PredictAPI : getStockSuggestions()
PredictAPI -> PredictRoutes : GET /api/predict/stock
PredictRoutes -> MLPipeline : predict_stock_for_api()
MLPipeline -> MySQL : 读取库存与预测数据
MySQL --> MLPipeline : 当前库存
MLPipeline -> MLPipeline : 计算安全库存与补货量
MLPipeline --> PredictRoutes : 补货建议
PredictRoutes --> PredictAPI : JSON 响应
PredictAPI --> PredictPage : 库存建议
PredictPage --> 用户 : 展示预测与补货结果
@enduml
